      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC FLETCH (2) tends to drift back and work into the race, finishing out of the placings two back before charging home into the minors latest when second (19.97) in a Grade 4/5 at this track last time. Solid record at the distance winning six races. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Can find winning form. GIGGLE HAT (5) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at his last four runs. Last start finished 2nd over 440m at this track beaten 0.8 lengths (25.11) behind Taw Mystique in a Grade 5 on September 18. Well-placed to take this out. JAYLA MAGIC (4) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 440m behind Layton Magic (25.34) in a Grade 4/5. One of the better hopes. QUEEN ERA (1) has strong credentials from this draw.",
